# Open hats on perc and sample at step 0; a closed hat on perc at step 4 cuts perc's open hat (to silence within
# ~30 ms), sample's open hat rings on; a pedal hat on sample at step 12 cuts it there. Then a half-open hat cut by
# a closed hat, and a ride that a closed hat must not cut.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 4.0
track perc
param p1 128 0
param p2 160 0
note 0 A3 4 110
note 4 F3 1 60
note 16 Ab3 2 110
note 18 F3 1 80
note 24 Gb4 1 110
note 26 F3 1 80
track sample
param p1 128 0
param p2 160 0
note 0 A3 8 110
note 12 G3 1 90
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 64
expect peak_below -6
